  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://semanticdatacharter.com/ns/sdc4/mc-hp420l0x5p6z0tk7nbcpsg0k">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://semanticdatacharter.com/ontology/sdc4-meta/ModelComponent"/>
    <sdc4-meta:isConstrainedByRmComponent rdf:resource="https://semanticdatacharter.com/ns/sdc4/sdc4.xsd#XdOrdinalType"/>
    <rdfs:label>Activity: Main path states</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>States of the Main path path of the Activity workflow, in order: ActivityProposed, ActivityPlanned, ActivityOngoing, ActivityCompleted. A transition is legal between adjacent states. An activity's lifecycle in the Data Privacy Vocabulary: proposed, planned, ongoing, halted, completed, not completed.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml"/>
  </rdf:Description>
